{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09722","headline":"丘中春卧寄王子 · 岑参","name":"丘中春卧寄王子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"田中开白室，林下闭玄关。\n卷迹人方处，无心云自闲。\n竹深喧暮鸟，花缺露春山。\n胜事那能说，王孙去未还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"星 汉"}